From b557bebdaa0039904db26e4fe5927e66186bdca1 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Fri, 27 Nov 2026 12:47:23 +0300
Subject: [PATCH] pipeline: simple: Exposure loop for the Qualcomm BPS
 converter

With the BPS as converter, the software ISP and its IPA are not used, so
nothing drives the sensor exposure. Measure the luminance of the processed
NV12 images (about 64 x 48 samples, every third frame) and adjust the
sensor exposure, then the analogue gain, towards a fixed target, with half
steps in the linear domain and highlight protection.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 src/libcamera/pipeline/simple/simple.cpp | 145 +++++++++++++++++++++++
 1 file changed, 145 insertions(+)

